# Test and tool dependencies of the CI jobs (ci.yml), locked with hashes in ci.txt. The jobs run
# `pip install --require-hashes -r requirements/ci.txt` and then install agentl itself with
# `pip install --no-deps --no-build-isolation -e .`. Keep this list in step with the `dev` extra
# in pyproject.toml. Regenerate ci.txt (one universal lock for Python 3.10 to 3.13, every OS) with:
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.10 --generate-hashes -o requirements/ci.txt requirements/ci.in
